==Icelandic==

===Verb===
{{is-verb-strong|brann|brunnum|brunnið}}

# {{context|intransitive|lang=is}} to [[burn]], to be [[on fire]]

====Derived terms====
* [[brunninn]]
* [[brenna allar brýr að baki sér]]
* [[brenna við]] (to get burned)
*: ''Maturinn '''brann við'''.''
*:: The food '''got burned'''.
* [[vilja brenna við]] (to tend to happen)
*: ''Það '''vill brenna við'''.''
*:: It '''tends to happen'''.''
* [[brenna í skinninu]] (to be [[raring]] to go)
*: ''Hann '''brennur í skinninu'''.''
*:: He's '''raring to go'''.''
* [[láta sér ekki allt fyrir brjósti brenna]] (to be not afraid of anything)

===Verb===
{{is-verb-weak|brenndi|brennt}}

# {{context|transitive|governs the accusative|lang=is}} to [[burn]], to [[set on fire]]
#: ''Ég '''brenndi''' mig á fingrinum!''
#:: I '''burnt''' my finger!
# {{context|transitive|governs the dative|lang=is}} to heat up with
#: ''Að '''brenna''' [[kol]]um.''
#:: To '''heat up with''' [[coal]]s.

====Derived terms====
* [[brenndur]]

===Noun===
{{is-noun|f|brennu|brennur}}

# a [[bonfire]]
#: ''Hvenær byrjar '''brennan'''?''
#:: When does the '''bonfire''' start?
# a [[burning]]

